  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "皮兰港：鱼雷机攻击",
    "en_us": "Piran Port: Torpedo Bomber Run"
  },
  "tags": [
    "piranport",
    "aviation",
    "torpedo"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "torpedo_attack_profile",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "平飞投雷全过程",
        "en_us": "Full Torpedo Run"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic_xl",
          "scale": 1.0,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "鱼雷机的攻击分三段：高空接近 → 贴水面平飞解算提前量 → 到投放点向下投雷，鱼雷入水后直线航行命中目标。",
            "en_us": "A torpedo bomber attacks in three phases: high-altitude approach → low flat run over the water while computing the lead → drop at the release point. The torpedo runs straight after splashdown — no homing."
          },
          "point": [
            4.5,
            3.5,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "minecraft:water",
          "blockPos": [0, 1, 0],
          "blockPos2": [8, 1, 8],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 60,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "目标在海面（示例用僵尸标记）。",
            "en_us": "The target floats on the surface (a zombie stands in)."
          },
          "point": [
            6.5,
            2.5,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_entity",
          "entity": "minecraft:zombie",
          "pos": [
            6.5,
            2.0,
            4.5
          ],
          "yaw": 270.0,
          "pitch": 0.0,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 60
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 60,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "第一阶段：高空接近。载机从远处接近目标。",
            "en_us": "Phase 1 — high approach. The bomber closes in on the target."
          },
          "point": [
            2.5,
            4.5,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "minecraft:white_wool",
          "blockPos": [0, 4, 4],
          "blockPos2": [1, 4, 4],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "minecraft:black_wool",
          "blockPos": [0, 4, 3],
          "blockPos2": [0, 4, 5],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "show_section_and_merge",
          "direction": "east",
          "linkId": "plane",
          "blockPos": [0, 4, 3],
          "blockPos2": [1, 4, 5],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 30
        },
        {
          "type": "move_section",
          "duration": 60,
          "linkId": "plane",
          "offset": [
            3.0,
            -2.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 70,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "第二阶段：贴水面平飞。载机降到目标上方约 3 格贴水面直飞，同时每刻解算提前量——预测点 = 目标当前位置 + 目标速度 × 鱼雷航行时间。",
            "en_us": "Phase 2 — flat run just above the water (~3 blocks up). The plane holds a steady heading while the lead is re-solved every tick: aim point = target position + target velocity × torpedo travel time."
          },
          "point": [
            4.5,
            2.5,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "move_section",
          "duration": 50,
          "linkId": "plane",
          "offset": [
            2.5,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 70,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "第三阶段：投放。距预测点约 10 格时投下鱼雷——落点不是目标当前位置，而是鱼雷入水航行到命中时目标会到的位置。",
            "en_us": "Phase 3 — release. At ~10 blocks from the predicted point the torpedo drops. The aim isn't where the target is now, but where it will be when the torpedo arrives."
          },
          "point": [
            5.5,
            2.5,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "item": "piranport:aerial_torpedo",
          "pos": [
            5.5,
            2.0,
            4.5
          ],
          "motion": [
            0.1,
            -0.3,
            0.0
          ],
          "count": 1,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 50
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 70,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "鱼雷入水后按投放瞬间的方向直线航行，无制导——提前量在平飞段就已解好。命中目标，或航程耗尽自爆。",
            "en_us": "After splashdown the torpedo runs straight on the heading fixed at release — no homing. It either hits the target or self-destructs at max range."
          },
          "point": [
            6.5,
            2.0,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 60
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 60,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "若目标静止，提前量为零——直接瞄当前位置投雷即可。目标移动时才需要预判。",
            "en_us": "On a stationary target the lead is zero — drop straight at its current position. The prediction only matters when the target is moving."
          },
          "point": [
            4.5,
            3.0,
            4.5
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 60
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [6, 2, 4],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
